OL,3,GNEWSAMatches raise funds after
OL,4,Aorganiser's transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international basketball tournament
OL,7,Fis raising funds for kidney disease
OL,8,Fresearch, 16 years after its founder
OL,9,Freceived an organ donation.
OL,11,FEric Douglin underwent a transplant
OL,12,Foperation in 2010 with a kidney his
OL,13,Fwife Mandi donated, following a
OL,14,Fdiagnosis of chronic kidney disease,
OL,15,Fexternal.
OL,17,FHe first organised the World Club
OL,18,FBasketball Tournament in 2015 to raise
OL,19,Ffunds for charity, with the 2026 event
OL,20,Ftaking place on Saturday and Sunday in
OL,21,FCanterbury.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
