OL,3,GNEWSAMatches raise funds after
OL,4,Aorganiser's transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We just wanted to give something back
OL,7,Fand raise awareness for all the kidney
OL,8,Fcharities and the need for organ donors
OL,9,Faround the world," Douglin said.
